## Tokens
Define variables on `:root` and use them across components.

```css
:root { --brand: #0d6efd; }
.button { background: var(--brand); }
```

## Grid basics
Define rows/columns and place items.

```css
.grid {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
  gap: 1rem;
}
```

## Media queries
Adjust layout and typography at breakpoints.

```css
@media (min-width: 768px) { .card { padding: 2rem; } }
```

## Delegate
Bind one handler to a parent and match targets.

```js
document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
  if (e.target.matches('[data-action]')) { /* ... */ }
});
```

## Fetch
Use `fetch()` with `await` and check `res.ok`.

```js
const res = await fetch('/data.json');
if (!res.ok) throw new Error('Request failed');
const data = await res.json();
```

## Exports
Use `export`/`import` for reuse and testing.

```js
// util.js
export function sum(a,b){ return a+b }
// app.js
import { sum } from './util.js'
```
